like it's top secret or classified. We want this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:16.860
information. So the news organizations are asking&nbsp;
the court to compel the government to turn it over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:22.740
to them. I hope this lawsuit works. I think it&nbsp;
needs to work for the good of the country because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:28.620
Tucker Carlson got that footage and did exactly&nbsp;
what everybody predicted he was going to do. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

